## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (2)
- `GET /auth/refresh` — Refresh the authentication token.
- `GET /portal/{portalJwt}` — Authenticate and retrieve user portal information.

### Data Read (3)
- `GET /{id}/remoteEntry.json` — Retrieve remote entry configuration.
- `GET /api/frontend` — Get frontend configuration data.
- `GET /portal/assets/i18n/en.json` — Get internationalization (i18n) data.

### Data Write (2)
- `POST /api/frontend/client/metrics` — Send client-side metrics.
- `POST /v1/batch` — Submit a batch of transactions.

